# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values.
#
# The RAG-only agent (src/agents/llm_client.py, Milestone 8B) uses the
# Anthropic Python SDK, which reads ANTHROPIC_API_KEY from the environment
# automatically (via anthropic.Anthropic()) — no other wiring is needed.
# Unit tests never require this: they use a fake LLMClient. It is only
# required to run experiments/run_rag_smoke_test.py against the real API.

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
